rse</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 4.50%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Dynamic Forces</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 2.59%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Boom</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 1.92%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Valiant</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 1.06%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Zenescope</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 0.76%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Avatar</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 0.74%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\">Other</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\">4.52%</td> </tr> </table></div> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table_t1\" style=\"border-spacing: 0px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> <b>Share of Overall Dollars</b></td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> Marvel</td> <td class=\"text_table_td1 text_table_t1_td\" style=\"padding: 0px\"> 33.50%</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_t1_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td1 t